37
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:31,413
The same journey is replayed after

38
00:01:31,413 --> 00:01:34,098
repair. It reaches confirmation,

39
00:01:34,098 --> 00:01:37,035
Axe reports zero violations, and keyboard

40
00:01:37,035 --> 00:01:39,971
focus has a visible, solid, three-pixel

41
00:01:39,971 --> 00:01:42,750
outline. The original

42
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:44,310
fixture remains unchanged.

43
00:01:45,182 --> 00:01:48,125
The fifteen-file Proof Bundle connects

44
00:01:48,125 --> 00:01:51,068
the findings, repair plan, exact diff,

45
00:01:51,068 --> 00:01:54,011
replay, audit records, and human-review

46
00:01:54,011 --> 00:01:56,815
boundaries. Its report shows

47
00:01:56,815 --> 00:01:59,681
the before and after states and

48
00:01:59,681 --> 00:02:02,547
three source-backed WCAG mappings, without

49
00:02:02,547 --> 00:02:03,502
