53
00:02:12,510 --> 00:02:15,287
AccessPatch detects it once, preserves

54
00:02:15,287 --> 00:02:18,064
the original fixture, and cleans the

55
00:02:18,064 --> 00:02:18,990
temporary runtime.

56
00:02:19,574 --> 00:02:22,007
Codex was the primary engineering

57
00:02:22,007 --> 00:02:24,611
environment. Under human

58
00:02:24,611 --> 00:02:27,503
coordination, it implemented most code,

59
00:02:27,503 --> 00:02:29,817
tests, security hardening, and

60
00:02:29,817 --> 00:02:32,641
